{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"war-card-game.copy.fields.summary","keys":["war-card-game.copy.fields.summary"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"ZXQPH0000QXZ-card deck guda, babu jokers. Raba daidai tsakanin 'yan wasa ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ; sanya wata takardar shaidar a gefe domin 'yan wasa uku. Mafi girman takardar shaidar na lashe kowace juyawa; suits ba su da muhimmanci. Ace mai girma, ZXQPH0003QXZ mai ƙaranci. Idan an yi daidai, duk 'yan wasa a cikin yakin suna sanya takardar shaidar daya ƙasa da daya sama. Mafi girman takardar shaidar da ke fuskar sama na karɓar duka. Idan ba za ka iya kammala yakin ba, za ka rasa. Wannan wasa na iya zama mai tsawo kuma mafi yawanci yana da kyau.","record_id":"a194d023228f766113c80767a9445e474fe3a9bd1a4766cc74c29d243ed48b6a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.500831194250054,"source":"One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1d2ad24094c0a116a056a7c33eca4bc529af719cccd080059fe2e87004f523b7","status":"needs-review","translation":"52-card deck guda, babu jokers. Raba daidai tsakanin 'yan wasa 2–4; sanya wata takardar shaidar a gefe domin 'yan wasa uku. Mafi girman takardar shaidar na lashe kowace juyawa; suits ba su da muhimmanci. Ace mai girma, 2 mai ƙaranci. Idan an yi daidai, duk 'yan wasa a cikin yakin suna sanya takardar shaidar daya ƙasa da daya sama. Mafi girman takardar shaidar da ke fuskar sama na karɓar duka. Idan ba za ka iya kammala yakin ba, za ka rasa. Wannan wasa na iya zama mai tsawo kuma mafi yawanci yana da kyau.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
